but-the-survivors-were-more-likely-to-breed-successfully/articleshow/132657960.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-27T17:15:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132659851,imgsize-131934.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[In 1992, Hurricane Andrew may have helped giant Burmese pythons spread across Florida's Everglades, creating one of America's worst invasive species crises]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132660980.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1992-hurricane-andrew-may-have-helped-giant-burmese-pythons-spread-across-floridas-everglades-creating-one-of-americas-worst-invasive-species-crises/articleshow/132660980.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1992-hurricane-andrew-may-have-helped-giant-burmese-pythons-spread-across-floridas-everglades-creating-one-of-americas-worst-invasive-species-crises/articleshow/132660980.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-27T17:50:10+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132661172,imgsize-266933.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Canadian TikToker with early-onset Alzheimer's ends her life through assisted dying]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132657430.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/canadian-tiktoker-with-early-onset-alzheimers-ends-her-life-through-assisted-dying/articleshow/132657430.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-